From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] 0227: on-screen guard; snaps show the layer under

bluefb_guard (default 1): 32 sample rows of each shown surface hashed
when its flip latches and when the flip replacing it is flushed; a
changed hash (drawn into while fetched: tearing, stripes) is counted and
logged. Also counted: rows changed between flip and latch (GPU finished
late) and between the replacing flip and release. Snaps of a two-layer
flip (0226) blend the app layer under backboardd's, premultiplied source
over, as the layer mixer does.
